From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fredric <fredric@acme.example>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 08:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(web): rename fetchJSON to requestJSON

The helper sends every method, not just GETs, and the old name kept leading
people to call fetch() directly for writes. Pure rename, no behaviour change.
